{"schema":1,"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.PrincGen:32:17","name":"pg_exists","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/PrincGen.lean","lines":[32,47],"atlasRow":412298,"chapter":"1.5992","archiveCommit":"40e56bab026552e089d7afcfeff08d2defb9c005","provenance":{"fileSha256":"61c35790be33f00ee6a74c8871d0e4fc269a7c2b04bb18cf42beb8e42b44484a","commandSha256":"2f365da4bc76ab57f9a5e92032134737412f6e966586e2493131710841c03df8"},"source":["private theorem pg_exists {l : ℕ} [Fact l.Prime] {c : ℕ} (h1 : 1 ≤ c) :","    ∃ v ∈ KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ l c, v ∉ KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ l (c + 1) := by","  have hirr : Irreducible (l : ℤ_[l]) := PadicInt.irreducible_p","  have hnu : ¬ IsUnit (-((l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c)) := by","    rw [IsUnit.neg_iff, isUnit_pow_iff (by omega)]","    exact hirr.not_isUnit","  have hu : IsUnit (1 + (l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c) := by","    have := (IsLocalRing.isUnit_or_isUnit_one_sub_self (-((l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c))).resolve_left hnu","    simpa [sub_eq_add_neg] using this","  refine ⟨hu.unit, ?_, ?_⟩","  · rw [KStar.TotallyRealRoots.mem_princ]","    simp","  · rw [KStar.TotallyRealRoots.mem_princ]","    simp only [IsUnit.unit_spec, add_sub_cancel_left]","    rw [pow_dvd_pow_iff hirr.ne_zero hirr.not_isUnit]","    omega"],"statementLines":[32,33],"proofLines":[33,47],"assume":["Assume `1 ≤ c` (h1)."],"show":"For every prime ℓ and natural c ≥ 1 there is a unit in ℤℓ congruent to one modulo ℓᶜ that is not congruent to one modulo ℓ^(c + 1).","strategy":"Use the explicit unit 1 + ℓᶜ.","steps":[{"id":"g-34-3","number":"⟨1⟩1","kind":"have","claim":"The element ℓ is irreducible in ℤℓ, hence is nonzero and a nonunit.","lines":[34,34],"headLines":[34,34],"snippet":"  have hirr : Irreducible (l : ℤ_[l]) := PadicInt.irreducible_p","uses":[],"refs":[],"typedFact":"Irreducible (l : ℤ_[l])","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-35-3","number":"⟨1⟩2","kind":"have","claim":"Since c ≥ 1 and ℓ is a nonunit, ℓᶜ is also a nonunit. Negation preserves unit status, so −ℓᶜ is a nonunit.","lines":[35,37],"headLines":[35,37],"snippet":"  have hnu : ¬ IsUnit (-((l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c)) := by\n    rw [IsUnit.neg_iff, isUnit_pow_iff (by omega)]\n    exact hirr.not_isUnit","uses":[],"refs":[],"typedFact":"¬ IsUnit (-((l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c))","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-38-3","number":"⟨1⟩3","kind":"have","claim":"In the local ring ℤℓ, at least one of a and 1−a is a unit. Taking a = −ℓᶜ, a nonunit, shows that 1+ℓᶜ is a unit.","lines":[38,40],"headLines":[38,40],"snippet":"  have hu : IsUnit (1 + (l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c) := by\n    have := (IsLocalRing.isUnit_or_isUnit_one_sub_self (-((l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c))).resolve_left hnu\n    simpa [sub_eq_add_neg] using this","uses":[],"refs":["g-35-3"],"typedFact":"IsUnit (1 + (l : ℤ_[l]) ^ c)","secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-41-3","number":"⟨1⟩4","kind":"apply","claim":"Choose v = 1+ℓᶜ as a unit of ℤℓ. Its difference from 1 equals ℓᶜ, which gives depth c and excludes depth c+1.","lines":[41,47],"headLines":[41,41],"snippet":"  refine ⟨hu.unit, ?_, ?_⟩","uses":[],"refs":["g-42-3","g-44-3"],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[{"id":"g-42-3","number":"⟨2⟩1","kind":"rewrite","claim":"The equality v−1 = ℓᶜ gives ℓᶜ ∣ v−1, hence v belongs to the principal-unit subgroup at c.","lines":[42,43],"headLines":[42,43],"snippet":"  · rw [KStar.TotallyRealRoots.mem_princ]\n    simp","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CyclotomicBounds.ClassNumberBounds.TotallyRealRoots.LeNuIffPowMemPrinc:49:9","name":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.mem_princ","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CyclotomicBounds/ClassNumberBounds/TotallyRealRoots/LeNuIffPowMemPrinc.lean","lines":[49,52],"atlasRow":424176,"owner":"1.7227"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]},{"id":"g-44-3","number":"⟨2⟩2","kind":"rewrite","claim":"Membership at c+1 would require ℓ^(c+1) ∣ ℓᶜ. For the nonzero nonunit ℓ, divisibility of its powers would then imply c+1 ≤ c. This is impossible, so v lies outside that subgroup.","lines":[44,47],"headLines":[44,47],"snippet":"  · rw [KStar.TotallyRealRoots.mem_princ]\n    simp only [IsUnit.unit_spec, add_sub_cancel_left]\n    rw [pow_dvd_pow_iff hirr.ne_zero hirr.not_isUnit]\n    omega","uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CyclotomicBounds.ClassNumberBounds.TotallyRealRoots.LeNuIffPowMemPrinc:49:9","name":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.mem_princ","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CyclotomicBounds/ClassNumberBounds/TotallyRealRoots/LeNuIffPowMemPrinc.lean","lines":[49,52],"atlasRow":424176,"owner":"1.7227"}],"refs":[],"typedFact":null,"secondRead":false,"children":[]}]}],"uses":[{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.AutomorphicVarieties.NumberFieldTowers.PrincGen:32:17","name":"pg_exists","kind":"theorem","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/AutomorphicVarieties/NumberFieldTowers/PrincGen.lean","lines":[32,47],"atlasRow":412298,"owner":"1.5992"},{"id":"Development.AutomorphicArithmetic.CyclotomicBounds.ClassNumberBounds.TotallyRealRoots.LeNuIffPowMemPrinc:16:19","name":"KStar.TotallyRealRoots.princ","kind":"def","file":"Development/AutomorphicArithmetic/CyclotomicBounds/ClassNumberBounds/TotallyRealRoots/LeNuIffPowMemPrinc.lean","lines":[16,16],"atlasRow":null,"owner":"1.7227"}],"counts":{"steps":6,"leaves":5,"parents":1,"secondRead":0,"typedFacts":3,"proofLines":15},"coverage":{"leaf":[[34,40],[42,47]],"parent":[[41,41]],"statement":[[33,33]],"introduction":[]},"component":"cohomology","chapterTitle":"Twisted cokernels in a cyclotomic tower","notePlace":{"item":"l:princ","where":"Lemma 8.3(c), proof","page":12,"dest":"theorem.8.3","name":"pg_exists","key":"pgExists"}}
